B.VW=new A.bA("Amazing is the affair of the believer \u2014 all of it is good for him: gratitude in ease, patience in hardship.","Suhayb ar-Rumi (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2999 \u2014 excerpt")
B.VH=new A.bA("No fatigue, illness, worry or grief touches a Muslim, even the prick of a thorn, but that Allah expiates some of his sins by it.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 5641 \u2014 excerpt")
