B.auE=new A.q_("Heavy & Light Letters (Tafkheem/Tarqeeq)","The seven heavy letters \u2014 \u062e \u0635 \u0636 \u063a \u0637 \u0642 \u0638 \u2014 rise from the tongue\u2019s back; the rest flow light. R\u0101\u02be follows what carries it.",B.aaM,"Making \u0642 sound like \u0643 or \u0637 like \u062a \u2014 the classic meaning-blurring pairs \u2014 is Lahn Jali. Slight heaviness/lightness drift is Lahn Khafi.","Tuhfat al-Atfal, verses 20, 33\u201335")
